      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you for confirming, Deepa. For your privacy, I just need to confirm it's you before I share any details. Could you tell me the last four digits of your registered mobile number?",
      "verified": false,
      "guard": [],
      "tools": []
    },
    {
      "role": "borrower",
      "text": "Yes, it's 6601."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Okay. Your personal loan EMI of nine thousand five hundred rupees was due on the twentieth of October and is now fourteen days overdue. As per your loan terms, a late payment charge of five hundred rupees has been added. Would you be able to clear it today? I can send you a secure payment link on SMS or WhatsApp.",
