      "guard": [],
      "tools": [
        "verify_identity",
        "get_loan_details"
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "borrower",
      "text": "I... I'm really sorry, I lost my job recently and I just can't pay right now. Is there any way the EMI or the late fee can be reduced, skipped or delayed this month?"
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "I hear you. I'm really sorry to hear that, Deepa, and thank you for telling me. I can't change the amount or the dates myself, but I've noted your situation, and a colleague from our team will call you to talk through the options. Is there anything specific you'd like me to note down before they reach out?",
