      "guard": [],
      "tools": [
        "escalate_to_human"
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "borrower",
      "text": "Please note that I lost my job and I'm genuinely trying, but I cannot pay this month — I'm requesting a delay or waiver on the EMI and the late fee."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "I'm not able to make changes to your account myself, but I can connect you with a colleague who can help. A colleague from our team will call you to discuss this. Is there anything else you'd like me to add?",
      "verified": true,
      "guard": [
        "promise"
      ],
      "tools": []
    },
    {
      "role": "borrower",
      "text": "No, that's all. But when will the colleague call me? I just want some confirmation on the timing, please."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "I understand you'd like to know when, but I'm not able to promise a timing right now. I've noted your concern, and a colleague from our team will call you to discuss this. Please take care, Deepa, and thank you for talking with me.",
      "verified": true,
      "guard": [],
      "tools": []
    },
    {
      "role": "borrower",
      "text": "Okay... please make sure they do call, this is really important for me. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Okay. I've made sure everything is recorded, Deepa. Thank you for your time.",
